            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Fetches a single model by id.\n\nHow to use: set the collection variable `model_id` (see `Create`).\n\nWhat to expect: `200 OK` with the model (including nested `brand`), or `404 Not Found` if it doesn't exist or is inactive. Cached in Redis (`models:{id}`).",
