            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Creates a new model linked to a brand.\n\nHow to use: send `{ \"brandId\": number, \"name\": string }` in the body — `brandId` must reference an existing brand (see `brands → Create`).\n\nWhat to expect: `201 Created` with the new model, including its `id`. Copy it into the collection variable `model_id` for the requests below. Invalidates the `models:all` cache.",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"brandId\": 1,\n    \"name\": \"lorem\"\n}",
              "options": {
